>## Unify two types, producing a substitution that makes them equal (or an error). The comment is attached to the generated constraint for diagnostics.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term unifyTypes = λcx,schemaTypes,l,r,comment.unifyTypeConstraints cx schemaTypes [typing.TypeConstraint{`left` = l, `right` = r, comment = comment}]
