>
>## Determine whether a type variable appears within a type expression.No distinction is made between free and bound type variables.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term variableOccursInType = λvar,typ0.let tryType := λb,typ.cases(model.Type){variable=λv.logic.or b (equality.equal (model.Name[] v) (model.Name[] var)), `_`=b} typ in rewriting.foldOverType coders.TraversalOrder{pre} tryType false typ0
